description	"The Guard

This unit weilds a melee weapon, lightsaber resistant armor, and a repeating blaster. 

^2Weaponry:
- Modified DC-15 Blaster Rifle (T-21 2)
- Vibroblade or Force Pike
-- ^3Yellow ^7/ ^1Red ^7/ ^5Cyan ^7Styles
-- Sword / Blaster Defense (1)

^8Attributes:
- Cortosis (1)
- Stamina (2)
- Heal (2)
- 1 Reinforcement (CTF: 20s Respawn)
- Assemble (1) - Respawns on characters with Rally

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]

^2Strengths^7: Can fight at most all ranges.
^1Weaknesses^7: Not especially strong at any particular range."